        <briefdescription>
<para>UART TXD/RXD encoding/decoding scheme. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Encoding scheme for data transmitted/received on TXD/RXD pins. The data can either be encoded as standard UART, or as an IrDA-compliant Serial Infrared stream, where the width of each pulse is 3/16th of the bit period. A low-power SIR encoding is also available, where the pulse width can be configured. </para>        </detaileddescription>
